Stage 1 of the audio roadmap ("Upgrades Needed for Production-Level Music
Creation"), no new dependencies:

- synth::envelope: any-stage envelopes with linear/exponential/step curves,
  sustain points, gated loops, velocity-to-level and -attack; ADSR, DAHDSR
- synth::osc: PolyBLEP/BLAMP saw, square, pulse (PWM), triangle; hard sync
  with a sub-sample BLEP at the reset, soft sync
- synth::noise: white, pink (Kellet), brown, blue, violet, velvet — seeded,
  slopes verified to ±1 dB/oct
- synth::wavetable: mip-mapped band-limited frames, frame morphing, Web
  Audio PeriodicWave from Fourier coefficients
- synth::additive: partials with ratios, offsets and envelopes; bell and
  drawbar presets
- synth::vector: Prophet-VS joystick weights and recorded paths
- synth::fm: six operators, all 32 DX7 algorithms, feedback (including the
  cross-operator loops of algorithms 4 and 6), phase and frequency modes;
  sidebands checked against Bessel J0/J1/J2
- synth::voice: polyphony with five steal policies, unison, mono/legato
  glide, sustain pedal, MPE; a subtractive reference voice
- modulation: LFOs as pure functions of beats/seconds (tempo-synced,
  dotted/triplet, S&H, smooth random, delay/fade), mod matrix, macros,
  MIDI learn
- fx::filter: TPT state-variable filter, Huovilainen ladder, one-pole,
  first-order all-pass, DC blocker, cubic delay line, comb, Schroeder
  all-pass
- fft: shared f64 radix-2 FFT; rng: seeded SplitMix64

147 unit tests, clippy clean.

