Stage 2 of the audio roadmap, no new dependencies:

- fx::fir: Kaiser-windowed FIR design, direct FIR, uniformly partitioned
  overlap-save FFT convolution (checked sample-for-sample against direct
  convolution)
- fx::reverb: Freeverb; an 8-line Hadamard FDN whose loop gains come from
  the requested RT60 (measured back by Schroeder integration to within
  15%); convolution reverb; synthetic stereo room IRs
- fx::modfx: chorus, flanger, phaser, tremolo and auto-pan (free or
  tempo-synced), vibrato, ring modulation
- fx::eq: parametric bands with 12–48 dB/oct Butterworth cuts, ISO octave
  and third-octave graphic EQ, dynamic EQ band, linear-phase EQ by
  frequency sampling
- fx::distortion: allocation-free 2/4/8x half-band oversampler (90 dB
  Kaiser), waveshaper (Web Audio table curves, tanh, hard, tube, fold,
  Chebyshev), bitcrusher, saturation with bias, exciter
- fx::dynamics: compressor/expander with external sidechain, lookahead,
  soft knee, stereo link and sidechain high-pass; brick-wall limiter whose
  ceiling is a proven bound (tested on 4x over-full-scale noise); gate
  with hysteresis/hold/range; transient designer; LR4 crossovers that sum
  flat; three-band phase-compensated multiband compressor

189 unit tests, clippy clean.

