From 5ae8efdd402853e5291640a373a7e536d01dd619 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 15:25:40 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 06/15] vieww-audio stage 6: sequencing, mixer, metering,
 presets, measurement, SIMD, threading, async loading

- sequencer: piano-roll clip model (select/nudge/resize/quantize with swing
  and strength/humanize/legato, looping event extraction, per-note MPE
  curves), step sequencer (swing, ratchets, seeded probability, polymeter),
  clip launcher (quantized launch, scenes, follow actions), arrangement,
  arpeggiator.
- mixer: tracks and buses, pre/post-fader sends, sidechain keys, VCAs,
  pan laws, width, polarity, solo that follows signal flow with solo-safe,
  graph validation with cycle refusal, plugin delay compensation, bypass
  that preserves timing, de-zippered parameters, meters, master loudness.
- meter: ITU-R BS.1770-4 / EBU R128 momentary, short-term, integrated and
  loudness range (EBU Tech 3341/3342 conformance cases), BS.1770 true peak,
  peak/RMS/VU/PPM ballistics, correlation, goniometer.
- preset: parameter metadata with tapers and text conversion, binary
  (CRC-checked) and text state formats, banks, A/B, gesture-coalesced
  undo, morphing; the mixer recalls through the same state.
- quality: multi-tone least-squares fitting, THD/THD+N/SINAD/SNR/ENOB,
  SMPTE IMD, AES17 dynamic range, IEC 61672 A-weighting, Farina sweeps
  and deconvolution, latency, fractional-octave bands, null depth.
- simd: runtime-dispatched AVX/SSE2/NEON kernels with scalar reference,
  wired into FIR and graph mixing.
- parallel: persistent worker pool, bit-identical to serial rendering;
  ParallelPoly splits polyphony across cores.
- loader: background decode with dedup, weak cache, cancel, progress and
  resampling; WAV disk streaming with race-free seek and looping.
- Stereo trait gains latency() and keyed processing; the real-time test
  now proves the mixer, parallel voices and disk streaming allocate nothing.

