+| Valid but extreme physics input could overflow integration/contact arithmetic and leave non-finite state while reporting success. | `PhysicsWorld::step` snapshots state and restores bodies plus accumulator if a substep produces invalid state. A regression test covers integration overflow. | Run tests; expand coverage to overflow during contact solving and repeated replay. |
